<title>TAIWAN: China Development in bonus, rights issue.</title>
<headline>China Development in bonus, rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Development Corp Corp, one of Taiwan's leading venture capital and investment firms, said on Wednesday it plans to issue a T$3 per share bonus and 421 million shares in rights issue on July 23.</p>
<p>It would conduct a bonus issue, or stock dividend, of T$3 per share, paying 300 free shares for every 1,000 shares held, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The rights issue of 421 million shares would have an underwriting price of T$71 per share, it said.</p>
</text>
